OL,3,GNEWSAHospital porters overtime row sees
OL,4,Atwo-day strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of hospital porters have started
OL,7,Fa two-day strike with a dispute about a
OL,8,Freduction in overtime rates left
OL,9,Funresolved.
OL,11,FRoyal Berkshire Hospital workers and
OL,12,Fthe GMB union said staff are being
OL,13,F"pushed towards poverty" and a recent
OL,14,Foffer to bridge a loss of earnings
OL,15,Funtil March was rejected by members.
OL,17,FSergio Dias, a porter and union
OL,18,Frepresentative, said staff at the
OL,19,FReading hospital were reluctant to
OL,20,Fstrike but that long-running concerns
OL,21,Fhave not been addressed.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
