OL,3,GNEWSAHospital porters overtime row sees
OL,4,Atwo-day strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Blythe, the chief executive of
OL,7,Fthe Royal Berkshire Hospital NHS Trust,
OL,8,Fsaid it was "really keen" to resolve
OL,9,Fthe dispute as soon as possible and
OL,10,Fthat services are running normally.
